{"id":"wb-7-1495","name":"莎车加满清真寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"莎车加满清真寺","text":"莎车加满清真寺也称加曼、贾玛、加米清真寺（维吾尔老文字：جامە مەسچىتى，拉丁维吾尔文：Jame meschiti），是中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区喀什地区莎车县历史最悠久且面积最大的清真寺。莎车加满清真寺是中华人民共和国第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8E%E8%BD%A6%E5%8A%A0%E6%BB%A1%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":91878642,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91878642","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9ccd73cfed68e0591ed2c5ef.png","title":"Yeken_Jüme_Meschiti_(20220519).png","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yeken_J%C3%BCme_Meschiti_(20220519).png","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/Yeken_J%C3%BCme_Meschiti_%2820220519%29.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Este Momento","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​莎车加满清真寺正门","width":320,"height":240}}